# Spec to Done

## Composite ownership

Own **SPECIFY â†’ PLAN â†’ EXECUTE â†” REPLAN â†’ REPORT** using only this tree. Never invoke another skill or ask the 
user to invoke a stage. Name the selected local reference, read it completely, apply it, return here, inspect again, 
and continue automatically. Pause only for a real interview answer, smallest ambiguity decision, authority, 
