rules:134](E:/projects/virtual-office/spec-interview/phase-6-meeting-notes/SPEC.md:134), [RLS 
requirement:204](E:/projects/virtual-office/spec-interview/phase-6-meeting-notes/SPEC.md:204). RLS alone does not 
restrict writable columns. [Supabase 
documentation](https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/postgres/column-level-security).  
26:    **Fix:** Require authorization against committed **pre-change** membership and participants, enforced at API 
and database/RPC boundaries. Completion must accept only the desired completion state. Protect ownership and parent 
